Spec: Reliable descriptor stream ownership

Purpose:
  Own a Binder-delivered socket descriptor with explicit directional shutdown and fixed attachment framing.

Owns:
  ./DescriptorDuplex.java

Must:
  Perform the bounded one-use attachment handshake before exposing application bytes.
  Use kernel shutdown to interrupt blocked reads/writes and preserve output-only FIN without closing input.
  Close every duplicated descriptor once and keep stream errors free of reflected peer data.
